  description="唯愛AI音樂學苑第一季收官講（原第四+第五合併 · 嘉賓 Li Yuan）。時間：2026年10月24日（週六）美西 17:30–18:30。形式：Zoom 直播。內容：層次（人聲/鼓/貝斯/吉他/鍵盤）→ 定稿（留什麼、砍什麼、何時停）。嘉賓：Li Yuan，十分鐘，旋律就是讓思想插翅膀。錄像回放與官方高清課件現已全面上線！" 
  path="/zh-TW/posts/2026-10-24-vi-ai-music-academy-lecture-4-arrangement/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/zh-TW/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>返回活動講座</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">
          <time datetime="2026-10-24">2026-10-24</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20 font-semibold">學苑收官講</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 font-semibold">錄像已上線</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">公益免費</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          唯愛AI音樂學苑收官講：編曲層次與定稿
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-amber-300 font-semibold">
          原第四+第五合併 · 嘉賓 Li Yuan
        </p>
        <p class="text-base text-purple-400 font-medium">
          唯愛智能基金會 · 唯愛智能公益基金會主辦 · 聯合北卡浙大校友會 · 北美高校聯盟
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Video & Fast Action Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-950/40 via-slate-900 to-blue-950/40 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-play text-red-500"></i>
              <span>Zoom 直播完整回放</span>
            </h3>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGkKw_qoWmuo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-purple-300 hover:text-purple-200 flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold">
              <span>官方系列播放列表 ↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <div class="aspect-video w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
            <iframe 
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/I-U_zP0WlOM" 
              title="唯愛AI音樂學苑收官講：編曲層次與定稿" 
              class="w-full h-full" 
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
              allowfullscreen
            ></iframe>
